  "description": "Santak 26\" Chopper Cruiser Bike – Power, Comfort, and Style with Fat Tires\nThe Santak 26\" beach cruiser bike is made of oversized Hi-ten steel and triple tree fork alloy crown fork, comfortable riding around. Stability and comfort are an assurance of the bicycle as it has been equipped with chrome fork and wide seat with springer and wide plush saddle. The Fat Tire 26x4.0” Beach Cruiser is a high-quality and powerful bike perfect for men who want to leave an impression with their bike.\n\nFORK\nTracer Triple Tree Dual Aluminum Crown Disc Brake\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather high density PU foam with springs\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\n40×34×120mm BMX Cranks set Bottom Bracket Cr-Mo axle.\n\nRIMS\nAlloy FAT 3\" 26” *36H*14G Spoke wheelset.\n\nEXTRAS\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
